{"id":2255,"date":"2024-09-19T12:32:12","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:32:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2255"},"modified":"2025-10-02T11:52:33","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T11:52:33","slug":"cardboard-postal-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-postal-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Postal Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Strong Corrugated Materials That Meet Shipping Standards<\/h2>\n<p>We at <em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em> offer high-quality, durable <strong>cardboard postal boxes<\/strong> designed to meet your everyday shipping, e-commerce, and packaging needs. Whether you&#8217;re shipping single items, promotional kits, or online orders, these boxes are built to keep your contents secure from warehouse to delivery.<\/p>\n<p>Available in all sizes and finishes, our boxes are manufactured using strong corrugated materials that meet shipping standards. If you&#8217;re planning to <strong>buy postal boxes<\/strong> in bulk, we offer competitive rates, fast turnaround times, and free nationwide shipping.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Packaging That Supports Daily Shipping Tasks<\/h2>\n<h3>Built for Protection and Professional Appearance<\/h3>\n<p>Cardboard postal boxes are used by online sellers, fulfillment centers, retail brands, and subscription-based businesses. They&#8217;re lightweight, recyclable, and easy to label\u2014making them ideal for frequent shipments.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flat-pack design for space-saving storage<\/li>\n<li>Quick assembly with self-locking flaps<\/li>\n<li>Suitable for national and international delivery<\/li>\n<li>Approved for courier and postal systems<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These boxes are perfect for packing cosmetics, apparel, books, small electronics, samples, documents, and promotional materials.<\/p>\n<h3>Custom Sizes and Layouts Available<\/h3>\n<p>We manufacture boxes to fit your product, not the other way around. Whether you need <strong>large cardboard postal boxes<\/strong> or compact formats for accessories, we can build it.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Dimensions<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Fully custom width, height, and depth<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated Cardboard, Kraft, SBS<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Self-locking flaps, Snap-lid, Peel Tabs<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[4