rong>\u00a0Proofing<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">3D Mockup, Flat View, or Sample Available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Digital or physical proof<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">All finishes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Free design assistance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Design Approval, Branding Consistency<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0 Design\u00a0 \u00a0Support<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Free Artwork Help Included<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Expert guidance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">All finishes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom templates, Mockups<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Startups, Growing Brands, Large Enterprises<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h2>Custom Printing and Coating Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Make Every Shipment Count<\/h3>\n<p>Packaging is more than just protection\u2014it\u2019s presentation. We offer a range of coatings to improve both appearance and durability.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gloss coating<\/strong> provides shine and a sleek finish<\/li>\n<li><strong>Matte coating<\/strong> gives a soft, modern surface<\/li>\n<li><strong>Spot UV<\/strong> lets you highlight specific text or logos<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"1034\">Interior printing is available for personalized touches like thank-you notes, promotional messages, or usage instructions. This feature is especially useful for industries where unboxing experience matters\u2014such as subscription kits, <strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1009\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-for-jewellery\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1007\">Cardboard Boxes For Jewellery<\/a><\/strong>, and small gift items.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1165\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">From clean branding to high-end product displays, custom printing transforms your postal boxes into an extension of your product.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Printing Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Color Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Branding Add-ons<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Best For<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Printing\u00a0 \u00a0Methods<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Offset, Digital, or Flexographic Printing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">CMYK Full Color, PMS, B\/W<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Metallic foil, Embossing, Debossing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Retail, E-commerce, Subscription Boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Printable\u00a0 \u00a0Areas<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">All Panels: Outside &amp; Inside, Flaps, Inserts<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Full Coverage or Select Areas<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Soft-touch, Textured Coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom patterns, Inside printing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gift Sets, Promotional Kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">\u00a0<strong>Brand\u00a0 \u00a0Elements<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Logos, Taglines, Product Info, QR Codes, Barcodes, Social Media Handles<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Single or Multi-Color<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Raised Ink, Spot Gloss<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Security seals, Holographic labels<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Luxury Packaging, Tech Products<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">\u00a0<strong>Custom\u00a0 \u00a0Graphics<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">High-resolution images, Illustrations, Icons<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Photo-quality or Vector Art<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matte, Gloss, Satin<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">UV Coating, Varnish highlights<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Food Packaging, Cosmetics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">\u00a0<strong>Add-On\u00a0 \u00a0Features<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Die-cut Windows, Peel Tabs, Locking Flaps, Thumb Notches<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matches box color scheme<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Edge-to-edge or Partial Print<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borde